eam/apps/2846530/extras/follow-ghost.gif?t=1738444699\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u27a4 Explore unsettling environments while solving puzzles,   <br>\u27a4 Reconstruct Anne's troubled story, <br>\u27a4 Escape from terrifying creatures lurking in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   <br>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/mostroworm2.gif?t=1738444699\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>FOLLOW</i> was developed in collaboration with psychologist Emanuela Papa, with the goal of accurately and sensitively representing the profound themes of this experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/brokenlore_follow-yellow2.gif?t=1738444699\" /></p>","developers":["Serafini Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/header.jpg?t=1738444699","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Serafini Productions \u00ae All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257082121,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082121/movie480.mp4?t=1734163198","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082121/movie_max.mp4?t=1734163198"},"name":"BrokenLore: FOLLOW - 2025 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257082121/0188e007e58bc9cc144ca975f528e197a50f287e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1734163198","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082121/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1734163198","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082121/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1